From d95fa7388859e4de6ffd3a6bf625e123008d171a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:21:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] feat(theme): add API MIX preset as default

Add an `apimix` theme preset (black x acid lime) mapping every palette
token for dark and light mode, opt it out of the primary-tinted surface
bridge, and make it the out-of-the-box preset. Dark becomes the default
color mode for visitors without a saved choice; saved cookies (including
an explicit `default` preset) keep working. Brand fonts load non-blocking.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNAh8zszdLbYYKhN2bHXj3
