Subject: [PATCH 2/8] feat(home): port approved API MIX landing page

Replace the built-in landing sections (shown when no custom home content
is configured) with the approved black x lime design: lime-blocked
headline, outlined MIX wordmark with draw-in and sheen, auth-aware CTAs,
endpoint list with lime sweep and scramble, lime capabilities band with
marquee, closing CTA and lime footer wordmark. Motion (intro hold, hero
parallax, magnetic buttons, scroll reveals, wordmark lift) is wired in
useLandingMotion with full cleanup and prefers-reduced-motion support.
Custom URL/HTML/markdown home content branches are unchanged.

