From 9fe74bf4040f7e7a4a07f6d65521f4e4e7dfcbec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:34:25 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] feat(auth): split brand/form layout for auth pages

AuthLayout now shows a brand panel (lime-blocked headline, faint
outlined MIX, OpenAI-compatible / pay-as-you-go / reliable points) next
to the unchanged auth form on desktop, and stacks form-first on phones.
The form sits in a card and inherits the theme's lime focus ring and
primary button. Applies to sign-in, sign-up and the other auth screens.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CNAh8zszdLbYYKhN2bHXj3
